{"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/objc(cs)NSObject"]},{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/objc(pl)NSObject","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s7CVarArgP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SH"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Teams reach an event from one of two places, and the split matters:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Login","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", which is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" stored here. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxeClient"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the teams walnut returned"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for its own session on the client itself, beside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"analyticsUserId"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"analyticsOrgName"},{"type":"text","text":", and hands them to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Amplitude"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UsageServiceClient"},{"type":"text","text":" when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constructs them. Keeping them per client is what stops two live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxeDevTools"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instances (a host’s own session and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoScanManager"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, say) from stamping each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other’s teams onto their events."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Injection","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", which is stored here, because it is genuinely process-wide: a host"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setTeams(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is asserting who is signed in "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"right now","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", not speaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for one client. An injected value therefore overrides the login value on every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client until a login supersedes it."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An injection outlives any one SDK session and is cleared only by the host replacing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, because only the host knows when its own session changed. A login deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not clear it: with more than one live client (a host’s own session and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AutoScanManager"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s, say) one client’s login would otherwise wipe an injection that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"belongs to another. A host that logs out injects an empty array, which is honoured."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads never throw and never block on a lookup: an unknown actor sends "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"teams: []"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than dropping an MAU-qualifying event over an optional dimension."}]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"axeDevToolsXCUI"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@M@axeDevToolsXCUI@objc(cs)AxeTeams","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxeTeams","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AxeTeams"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeTeams\/setTeams(_:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/documentation\/axeDevToolsXCUI\/AxeTeams"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The host-injection channel for the actor’s team memberships, which are stamped onto"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every usage service and Amplitude event so MAU reporting can slice by team without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later join against billing-service (#3130)."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeteams"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axedevtoolsxcui\/axeteams"]}],"references":{"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/SH":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/SH","title":"Swift.Hashable"},"doc://com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI/documentation/axeDevToolsXCUI/AxeTeams/setTeams(_:)":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTeams:","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.deque.axeDevToolsXCUI\/docume